<span class="vc-dot d0 is-best" style="left:100.0%"><i>Parc Clematis</i><em>124</em></span>
<span class="vc-dot d1 is-mid" style="left:77.8%"><i>Treasure</i><em>120</em></span>
<span class="vc-dot d2 is-worst" style="left:0.0%"><i>Stirling</i><em>106</em></span>
</div></div>
<div class="vc-m lvl"><div class="vc-h"><b>Lease remaining</b><span>level — will not decide it</span></div>
<div class="vc-track"><span class="vc-rail"></span><span class="vc-end">lower</span><span class="vc-end r">higher</span>
<span class="vc-dot d0 is-flat" style="left:100.0%"><i>Parc Clematis</i><em>92 yrs</em></span>
<span class="vc-dot d1 is-flat" style="left:50.0%"><i>Treasure</i><em>91 yrs</em></span>
<span class="vc-dot d2 is-flat" style="left:0.0%"><i>Stirling</i><em>90 yrs</em></span>
</div></div>
<div class="vc-m"><div class="vc-h"><b>To the nearest MRT</b><span>about 1.8× apart</span></div>
<div class="vc-track"><span class="vc-rail"></span><span class="vc-span" style="left:0.0%;width:100.0%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--good),var(--bad))"></span><span class="vc-end bad">furthest ▼</span><span class="vc-end good r">▲ nearest</span>
<span class="vc-dot d0 is-mid" style="left:68.9%"><i>Parc Clematis</i><em>607 m</em></span>
<span class="vc-dot d1 is-worst" style="left:100.0%"><i>Treasure</i><em>706 m</em></span>
<span class="vc-dot d2 is-best" style="left:0.0%"><i>Stirling</i><em>388 m</em></span>
</div></div>
<div class="vc-m"><div class="vc-h"><b>Size that trades</b><span>31% apart</span></div>
<div class="vc-track"><span class="vc-rail"></span><span class="vc-end">lower</span><span class="vc-end r">higher</span>
<span class="vc-dot d0 is-flat" style="left:100.0%"><i>Parc Clematis</i><em>861 sq ft</em></span>
<span class="vc-dot d1 is-flat" style="left:10.3%"><i>Treasure</i><em>678 sq ft</em></span>
<span class="vc-dot d2 is-flat" style="left:0.0%"><i>Stirling</i><em>657 sq ft</em></span>
</div></div>
<div class="vc-m"><div class="vc-h"><b>Typical price paid</b><span>57% apart</span></div>
<div class="vc-track"><span class="vc-rail"></span><span class="vc-end">lower</span><span class="vc-end r">higher</span>
<span class="vc-dot d0 is-flat" style="left:100.0%"><i>Parc Clematis</i><em>S$1,960,000</em></span>
<span class="vc-dot d1 is-flat" style="left:0.0%"><i>Treasure</i><em>S$1,248,000</em></span>
<span class="vc-dot d2 is-flat" style="left:39.3%"><i>Stirling</i><em>S$1,528,000</em></span>
</div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="vx-sec"><h3>E &mdash; Editorial, facts under prose</h3><p class="vx-note">Leads with the three real differences as sentences, now annotated &mdash; figures sit in tinted chips, the leader and trailer are named inline, and the facts table underneath carries the same green and red marks so the prose and the table agree at a glance.</p><div class="ve">
<div class="ve-p"><h5>Against its district <em>about 3.8× apart</em></h5><p><b class="">Parc Clematis</b> <span class="ve-v ">+16%</span> &nbsp;against&nbsp; <b class="">Stirling Residences</b> <span class="ve-v ">+4%</span></p></div>
<div class="ve-p"><h5>To the nearest MRT <em>about 1.8× apart</em></h5><p><b class="ve-n-good">Stirling Residences</b> <span class="ve-v good">388 m</span> <i class="ve-tag good">▲ nearest</i> &nbsp;against&nbsp; <b class="ve-n-bad">Treasure At Tampines</b> <span class="ve-v bad">706 m</span> <i class="ve-tag bad">▼ furthest</i></p></div>
<div class="ve-p"><h5>Typical price paid <em>57% apart</em></h5><p><b class="">Parc Clematis</b> <span class="ve-v ">S$1,960,000</span> &nbsp;against&nbsp; <b class="">Treasure At Tampines</b> <span class="ve-v ">S$1,248,000</span></p></div>
<table class="ve-t"><thead><tr><th class="ve-corner">Measure</th><th><b>Parc Clematis</b><span>D5<em> &middot; Buona Vista / Clementi / Dover</em></span></th><th><b>Treasure At Tampines</b><span>D18<em> &middot; Tampines / Pasir Ris</em></span></th><th><b>Stirling Residences</b><span>D3<em> &middot; Tiong Bahru / Queenstown</em></span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class=""><th>Median resale price<i>no better end</i></th><td class="is-flat">S$2,258 psf</td><td class="is-flat">S$1,799 psf</td><td class="is-flat">S$2,384 psf</td></tr>
<tr class=""><th>Against its district<i>no better end</i></th><td class="is-flat">+16%</td><td class="is-flat">+13%</td><td class="is-flat">+4%</td></tr>
<tr class=""><th>Resales in 12 months</th><td class="is-best">124</td><td class="is-mid">120</td><td class="is-worst">106</td></tr>
<tr class="lvl"><th>Lease remaining<i>level</i></th><td class="is-flat">92 yrs</td><td class="is-flat">91 yrs</td><td class="is-flat">90 yrs</td></tr>
<tr class=""><th>To the nearest MRT</th><td class="is-mid">607 m</td><td class="is-worst">706 m</td><td class="is-best">388 m</td></tr>
<tr class=""><th>Size that trades<i>no better end</i></th><td class="is-flat">861 sq ft</td><td class="is-flat">678 sq ft</td><td class="is-flat">657 sq ft</td></tr>
<tr class=""><th>Typical price paid<i>no better end</i></th><td class="is-flat">S$1,960,000</td><td class="is-flat">S$1,248,000</td><td class="is-flat">S$1,528,000</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p class="ve-n">Level on lease &mdash; those will not decide it.</p>
</div></section>
</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
